# GüvenPoliçe API — REST Client (VS Code) / JetBrains HTTP Client
# Refresh token httpOnly cookie'dir; istemcinin cookie jar'ı otomatik taşır.
@api = http://localhost:8080
@password = Demo-Parola-2026

### Sağlık
GET {{api}}/health

### Metrikler
GET {{api}}/metrics

### Giriş (acente)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "acente@guvenpolice.test", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Oturumdaki kullanıcı
GET {{api}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Müşteriler (AGENT/UNDERWRITER)
GET {{api}}/api/v1/customers?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Refresh (cookie ile)
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/refresh

### Çıkış
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Yanlış parola → 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{api}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "acente@guvenpolice.test", "password": "yanlis"}
